        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "Heard.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 341,
      "end": 348,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "The challenge in this petition is made to the FIR No.388 of 2023, dated 04.09.2023, under Sections 120-B, 420, 506 IPC, Police Station Kotwali Dehradun, District Dehradun.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 350,
      "end": 521,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "04.09.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 422,
          "end": 432
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 120-B",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 440,
          "end": 454
        },
        {
          "text": "420",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 456,
          "end": 459
        },
        {
          "text": "506",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 461,
          "end": 464
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 465,
          "end": 468
        },
        {
          "text": "Police Station Kotwali Dehradun",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 470,
          "end": 501
        },
        {
          "text": "Dehradun",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 512,
          "end": 520
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.05943521857261658
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "According to the FIR, the informant is in contact with the petitioner no.1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 522,
      "end": 598,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1892899125814438
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "They started business together.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 599,
      "end": 630,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3166935443878174
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "It grew with the time.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 631,
      "end": 653,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23870007693767548
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The FIR is quite in detail, as to how the things move in favour or the business, which was together started by the informant and the petitioner no.1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 654,
      "end": 803,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14734792709350586
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The FIR records that the petitioner no.1 Gaurav Kumr Pathak did not share the profits with the informant and threatened the informant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 804,
      "end": 938,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Gaurav Kumr Pathak",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 845,
          "end": 863
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.35134294629096985
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The FIR also records the role of petitioner nos.2 and 3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 939,
      "end": 996,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20213714241981506
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the informant would submit that under a design, the petitioner no.1 cheated the informant, who had revived his company.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 996,
      "end": 1135,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2524315118789673
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The petitioner no.1 expelled one of the partners and inducted his wife, the petitioner no.2 as a Director.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1136,
      "end": 1242,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.41156768798828125
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The business of the company grew only because of the participation of the informant, but he has been cheated and not shared with the profits.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1243,
      "end": 1384,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4131312966346741
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Having considered, this Court is of the view that this matter requires deliberation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1385,
      "end": 1470,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.05109867453575134
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Learned A.G.A. takes notices on behalf of respondent nos.1 and 2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1471,
      "end": 1537,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Mr. Viplav Sharma, Advocate takes notice on behalf of respondent no.3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1538,
      "end": 1609,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Viplav Sharma",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1543,
          "end": 1556
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Admit.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1611,
      "end": 1617,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06642758846282959
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Counter affidavit to be filed within three weeks.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1618,
      "end": 1668,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06969767063856125
    },
